{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Water Margin Scrolls</i>, you'll form your own Liangshan squad to take into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/\u7ec4\u5efa\u5c0f\u961f.gif?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power Up Your Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your heroes' stats and abilities using herbs and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/\u5f3a\u5316.gif?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Auto Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is fully automated\u2014victory depends on how well you build and position your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/\u6218\u6597\u573a\u666f.gif?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Loot and Recruit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Story Mode, you\u2019ll have a chance to recruit legendary heroes from <i>Water Margin</i> and add them to your personal deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/shuabao.png?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Your Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the [Collection] feature to build your own deck and discover powerful synergies between characters and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/sreenshot3.png?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Add to Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the <strong>Add to Wishlist</strong> button above to get notified at launch and enjoy an exclusive launch discount.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583540?t=1747357766","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583540?t=1747357766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/a4c9e3b3cbf9a1948551013f589e94398bbff3de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747357766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/a4c9e3b3cbf9a1948551013f589e94398bbff3de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747357766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Water Margin Scrolls</i>, you'll form your own Liangshan squad to take into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/\u7ec4\u5efa\u5c0f\u961f.gif?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power Up Your Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your heroes' stats and abilities using herbs and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/\u5f3a\u5316.gif?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Auto Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is fully automated\u2014victory depends on how well you build and position your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/\u6218\u6597\u573a\u666f.gif?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Loot and Recruit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Story Mode, you\u2019ll have a chance to recruit legendary heroes from <i>Water Margin</i> and add them to your personal deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/shuabao.png?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Your Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the [Collection] feature to build your own deck and discover powerful synergies between characters and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/extras/sreenshot3.png?t=1747357766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Add to Wishlist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the <strong>Add to Wishlist</strong> button above to get notified at launch and enjoy an exclusive launch discount.</p>","developers":["QingHe Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583540/c3f75a984e15a14d184d8320137d08f2923fe849/header.jpg?t=1747357766","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla